with all reported in USD. Revenue was 391,035,000,000 USD — total net sales for the year. Operating income was 123,216,000,000 USD — the profit remaining after cost of sales and operating expenses (R&D and SG&A), i.e., earnings from operations before non-operating items and taxes. Net income was 93,736,000,000 USD — the bottom-line result after non-operating items and income taxes. The distinction: revenue is the top line; operating income captures core operating profitability; net income is the final profit attributable after all other income/expense and taxes. Operating income represents about 31.5% of revenue and net income about 24.0% of revenue. All figures are from the same annual fiscal period, so they are directly comparable.", "metrics": [{"company": "AAPL", "name": "revenue", "fiscal_year": 2024, "value": "391035000000", "currency": "USD", "unit": "USD", "period_start": "2023-10-01", "period_end": "2024-09-28", "period_kind": "annual_flow", "evidence_id": "3a4cc27cbd17e4635166de5a", "report_year": 2025, "extraction_method": "sec_companyfacts_annual_context"}, {"company": "AAPL", "name": "operating_income", "fiscal_year": 2024, "value": "123216000000", "currency": "USD", "unit": "USD", "period_start": "2023-10-01", "period_end": "2024-09-28", "period_kind": "annual_flow", "evidence_id": "eb3b24cbd31d94017022417a", "report_year": 2025, "extraction_method": "sec_companyfacts_annual_context"}, {"company": "AAPL", "name": "net_income", "fiscal_year": 2024, "value": "93736000000", "currency": "USD", "unit": "USD", "period_start": "2023-10-01", "period_end": "2024-09-28", "period_kind": "annual_flow", "evidence_id": "7dbcb598fc034f946ef3ad52", "report_year": 2025, "extraction_method": "sec_companyfacts_annual_context"}], "calculations": [], "periods_aligned": null, "evidence_ids": ["3a4cc27cbd17e4635166de5a", "eb3b24cbd31d94017022417a", "7dbcb598fc034f946ef3ad52"]}, "events": [{"tool": "get_financial_metrics", "company": "AAPL", "metric": "revenue", "fiscal_year"