ptember, not a calendar year). All three measures are annual flows reported in USD. Revenue (total net sales, i.e., the top line) was 391,035,000,000 USD. Operating income (the profit remaining after cost of sales and operating expenses, before non-operating items and taxes) was 123,216,000,000 USD, which is about 31.5% of revenue. Net income (the bottom line, after non-operating results and income taxes) was 93,736,000,000 USD, about 24.0% of revenue. The interpretation: operating income is a pre-tax, operating-only profit measure and sits above net income; the 29,480,000,000 USD gap between operating income and net income reflects the effect of non-operating items and the tax provision. Units and actual fiscal dates are preserved in the returned metric objects.", "metrics": [{"company": "AAPL", "name": "revenue", "fiscal_year": 2024, "value": "391035000000", "currency": "USD", "unit": "USD", "period_start": "2023-10-01", "period_end": "2024-09-28", "period_kind": "annual_flow", "evidence_id": "3a4cc27cbd17e4635166de5a", "report_year": 2025, "extraction_method": "sec_companyfacts_annual_context"}, {"company": "AAPL", "name": "operating_income", "fiscal_year": 2024, "value": "123216000000", "currency": "USD", "unit": "USD", "period_start": "2023-10-01", "period_end": "2024-09-28", "period_kind": "annual_flow", "evidence_id": "eb3b24cbd31d94017022417a", "report_year": 2025, "extraction_method": "sec_companyfacts_annual_context"}, {"company": "AAPL", "name": "net_income", "fiscal_year": 2024, "value": "93736000000", "currency": "USD", "unit": "USD", "period_start": "2023-10-01", "period_end": "2024-09-28", "period_kind": "annual_flow", "evidence_id": "7dbcb598fc034f946ef3ad52", "report_year": 2025, "extraction_method": "sec_companyfacts_annual_context"}], "calculations": [], "periods_aligned": null, "evidence_ids": ["3a4cc27cbd17e4635166de5a", "eb3b24cbd31d94017022417a", "7dbcb598fc034f946ef3ad52"]}, "events": [{"tool": "get_financial_metrics", "company": "AAPL", "met